+| Q6 | **Architecture facts:** stack, whether subfolders/attachments/export/search index exist, per-user quotas, whether a client version header exists, and how note IDs are cached on iOS. | Eng lead | Week 1 | Assumptions as written. Any "yes" on subfolders or attachments adds authz scope in S0. |
