+
+## 12. Risks
+
+| # | Risk | Likelihood | Mitigation |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| R1 | Simultaneous note-taking during meetings produces lots of conflicted copies and feels broken | Medium-High | Conflict-rate metric and alert. Copy and banner make the cause clear. This is the trigger for a real-time v2. Ask beta accounts how they take notes. |
+| R2 | A note-touching route that bypasses `canAccess` leaks data | Medium | Single authz function, route inventory, AC15 test sweep, and 404-for-non-members. |
+| R3 | iOS misses the window, so owners lose iOS visibility of folders they share | High | Disclosed in the share dialog. Web launch doesn't depend on iOS. Submit by 11/11. |
+| R4 | The customers' real need is a team workspace, and folder sharing gets reworked later | Medium | Keep `folder_members` generic so a future workspace can grant membership. Validate in beta interviews. |
+| R5 | Polling load at scale | Low (beta) | Load check in week 5. Back off polling when the tab is hidden. |
+| R6 | Pricing decision lands late | Medium | Config-driven gate (D6). Only the copy changes. |
+
+**Confidence:**
